<LanguageData>
  <VFET_OpportunitySite_WildMen.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription-> [asker_nameFull] of [asker_faction_name], found out about an existence of a small tribe of wild men near [map_definite]. Wild men most likely mean us no harm, and are gathering together hoping to that the numbers will help them survive.
\nWe may decide to venture to the gathering in order to crush the wild men. Alternatively, we may leave them be. In time, these wild men may find their way to us - depending on their numbers, they may choose to join us, or attack us instead. [asker_nameFull] has a feeling that the small tribe consists of [ListofPawns].-->
    <li>[asker_faction_name] 的 questDescription-&gt; [asker_nameFull]，发现 [map_definite] 附近存在一小群野人。野人很可能无意伤害我们，他们聚集在一起，希望这些数字能够帮助他们生存。

我们可能决定冒险参加聚会，以粉碎野人。或者，我们也可以不理会它们。随着时间的推移，这些野人可能会找到我们的路——根据他们的数量，他们可能会选择加入我们，或者攻击我们。 [asker_nameFull]感觉这个小部落是由[ListofPawns]组成的。</li>
  </VFET_OpportunitySite_WildMen.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
